OVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\r\nIMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\r\nFITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.  IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\r\nAUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN\r\nAN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN\r\nCONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1738426566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1749896457","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177#issuecomment-1749896457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177","id":1749896457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85oTU0J","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-06T02:21:40Z","updated_at":"2023-10-06T02:21:40Z","body":"it's actually quite close to mit-open-group, but omits the copyright notice reproduction obligation.\r\n\r\n+1 to add, but not sure on name...","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1749896457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1774320334","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177#issuecomment-1774320334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177","id":1774320334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85pwfrO","user":{"login":"whot","id":1487352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODczNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1487352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot","html_url":"https://github.com/whot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-23T02:07:36Z","updated_at":"2023-10-23T02:07:36Z","body":"cc @jexposit ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1774320334/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1781226867","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177#issuecomment-1781226867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177","id":1781226867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85qK11z","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-26T14:18:36Z","updated_at":"2023-10-26T14:18:36Z","body":"Agree that this one is (annoyingly) close-but-not-quite to https://spdx.org/licenses/HPND-sell-variant-MIT-disclaimer.html. Differences appear to be:\r\n\r\n1. First paragraph includes separate sentence of \"This permission notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.\" and doesn't include HPND-sell-variant-MIT-disclaimer's text \"the above copyright notice appear in all copies and that both that copyright notice and\"\r\n2. Doesn't include the formatted \"Disclaimer\" ASCII art box\r\n3. Final paragraph is all-caps (but I _think_ otherwise identical)\r\n\r\n2 seems easy to mark as optional, and 3 I think is not relevant for matching purposes. But 1 is (again, annoyingly) I think arguably substantively different, and also would be challenging to include with markup.\r\n\r\nGiven that, I'm inclined to add this one as a separate license ID / name. Not sure what best to use for the ID and name. @whot, is xserver the only project where you're seeing this particular formulation used? \r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1781226867/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1782099581","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177#issuecomment-1782099581","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177","id":1782099581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85qOK59","user":{"login":"whot","id":1487352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODczNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1487352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot","html_url":"https://github.com/whot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-27T00:10:58Z","updated_at":"2023-10-27T00:10:58Z","body":"> @whot, is xserver the only project where you're seeing this particular formulation used?\r\n\r\nYes, AFAICT. This one is a bit trickier to search for but as I said above it stems from one author and none of the other projects I can grep for his name (or NSA in more general) list the same copyright notice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1782099581/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1803118538","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177#issuecomment-1803118538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177","id":1803118538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85reWfK","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-09T03:47:27Z","updated_at":"2023-11-09T03:47:27Z","body":"ugh, this is a naming conundrum!  I really wish we hadn't used \"variant\" in the ID for HPND-sell - it ends up being superfluous characters...\r\n\r\nnot sure if now using `HPND-sell-MIT-disclaimer-no-copyright` would be any better?\r\nas NSA nor xserver are in the text of the license, those seem less helpful?\r\n\r\nunless we just did something like `HPND-sell-xserver` and used the Notes to explain the similarity re: MIT disclaimer text?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1803118538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1804268102","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177#issuecomment-1804268102","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2177","id":1804268102,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85rivJG","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-09T17:35:00Z","updated_at":"2023-11-09T17:35:00Z"